  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan recalls reaching rank six in a previous life, shedding his mortal body and becoming a Gu immortal.",
      "chapters": [
        135
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Cultivators at rank five are mortals and those at rank six are immortals; one rank across that divide is a world apart, the difference between heaven and earth.",
      "chapters": [
        211
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reaching rank six is a qualitative change from mortal to immortal.",
      "chapters": [
        231
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu immortals at rank six sit beyond ordinary mortal-realm rankings and cannot be scored on that scale.",
      "chapters": [
        281
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A blessed land is an independent small world. The Gu Immortal rules that land.",
      "chapters": [
        325
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blessed-land-and-scale",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A blessed land can only be created by a Gu Immortal and is the foundation of that immortal’s wealth. Mortal Gu Masters usually raise five or six Gu, while Gu Immortals can raise a million or even ten million Gu worms.",
      "chapters": [
        409
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blessed-land-and-scale",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_mortal_gu",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu Immortals possess immortal essence; a bead of it can stand as unlimited primeval essence, so every Gu Immortal can control large numbers of mortal Gu without running dry.",
      "chapters": [
        587
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blessed-land-and-scale",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu Masters at rank one to rank five all suffer the restraints of primeval essence. Only after going beyond mortal and becoming a Gu Immortal do they gain endless primeval essence.",
      "chapters": [
        341
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "primeval-essence-and-life",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "For many rank five peak stage Gu Masters, the greatest goal is to break away from mortal and charge through to the rank six Gu Immortal realm, thereby gaining a longer life.",
      "chapters": [
        373
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "primeval-essence-and-life",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Peak stage at rank five is the finishing line of mortal Gu Masters. Gu Immortals at rank six are beyond mortal, and becoming a Gu Immortal is only a new starting point.",
      "chapters": [
        609
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "new-starting-point",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The rank ladder is covered on ranks and realms. Ascension itself is covered on immortal ascension. Gu at rank six and above are covered on Immortal Gu. Cultivators below the divide are covered on Gu Masters.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "new-starting-point",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_ranks_and_realms",
        "sys_immortal_ascension",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    }
  ],
